  "notes": "Death Order: Simon Says is a survival game from Voxq Enterprises where you wake up locked in a prison and have to obey Simon. Each round he calls out orders, and you only follow the ones that start with \"Simon Says\". Move when you should not, or miss a real order, and you are out. Rounds keep getting harder, and the last players still standing win.\n\nCodes in this game give Cash, the currency you spend on prison suits and other looks for your character. The two 5,000 Cash codes are worth grabbing first because they give five times more than the rest. New codes usually show up in the Discord when the game gets an update or passes a milestone, and the developers sometimes put one straight into the game's Roblox description, like RELEASE.",
